OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA wet and very windy day
OL,6,Fassociated with Storm Austen. Heavy
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain push through,
OL,8,Fclearing from the southwest during the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Disruptive winds likely
OL,10,Fwith severe gales along southern and
OL,11,Fwestern coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA mostly dry night before
OL,14,Frain arrives from the west in the
OL,15,Fearly hours. Winds slowly ease
OL,16,Fovernight before starting to pick up
OL,17,Falong the west coast by dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
