OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FAnother wet and windy day as
OL,6,FStorm Boelo pushes in from the west.
OL,7,FWidespread heavy rain and disruptive
OL,8,Fwinds, these reaching severe gale
OL,9,Fforce along coasts.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FA
OL,12,Fbrighter day on Sunday with isolated
OL,13,Fshowers and remaining windy until
OL,14,Fevening. Unsettled conditions return
OL,15,Fat the start of the week with rain and
OL,16,Fstrong winds arriving early Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
